        ],
        "text": {
          "en": "Integers include positive numbers, zero and negative numbers. On the number line, numbers to the right of zero are positive and to the left are negative.\nTo add a positive number we move right; to add a negative number we move left. 3 plus minus 5 is minus 2.\nA bigger number is farther right: minus 2 is greater than minus 5."
        }
